{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "SAS Viya Authentication API",
    "description": "SAS Viya 認證端點文檔。\n\n使用 SASLogon OAuth 2.0 取得 access token，所有其他 SAS Viya API 呼叫均需以此 token 進行認證。\n\n**認證流程**：\n1. 使用帳號密碼 POST 取得 `access_token` 與 `refresh_token`\n2. 後續 API 請求 header 帶入 `Authorization: Bearer {access_token}`\n3. `access_token` 過期時使用 `refresh_token` 重新取得\n\n**重要**：SASLogon 的 OAuth token flow 可能使用 HTTP Basic Auth 承載已註冊 OAuth client 的認證資訊。\n對 `client_credentials` 而言，應使用已註冊 client 自身的認證資訊，不可將單一固定值誤認為通用 official contract。\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{sas_viya_host}",
      "description": "SAS Viya 伺服器",
      "variables": {
        "sas_viya_host": {
          "default": "your-sas-viya-instance",
          "description": "SAS Viya 主機位址（由環境變數 `domain` 設定）"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/SASLogon/oauth/token": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "取得 Access Token",
        "operationId": "obtainAccessToken",
        "tags": [
          "Authentication"
        ],
        "description": "使用帳號密碼（password grant）、refresh token，或 client credentials 向 SAS Viya 取得 OAuth access token。\n\n**HTTP Method**：POST\n\n**使用場景**：\n- 初次登入，取得 `access_token` 與 `refresh_token` (password grant)\n- `access_token` 過期時，使用 `refresh_token` 重新取得\n- service-to-service 或 tests-only bounded baseline 可使用 `client_credentials`\n- upstream raw spec 也記錄 Basic Auth + `grant_type=client_credentials` 的替代做法；\n  但此 repo-local published contract 只凍結 form-body baseline，不把該替代做法建成可獨立驗證的 request branch\n\n**來源程式碼**：`utils/_async/_token.py`\n",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PasswordGrantRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefreshTokenGrantRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClientCredentialsGrantRequest"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "password_grant": {
                  "summary": "帳號密碼登入",
                  "value": {
                    "grant_type": "password",
                    "username": "your_username",
                    "password": "your_password"
                  }
                },
                "refresh_token_grant": {
                  "summary": "使用 refresh_token 重新取得",
                  "value": {
                    "grant_type": "refresh_token",
                    "refresh_token": "your_refresh_token"
                  }
                },
                "client_credentials_grant": {
                  "summary": "repo-local form-body baseline",
                  "value": {
                    "grant_type": "client_credentials",
                    "client_id": "your_client_id",
                    "client_secret": "your_client_secret"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功取得 access token；`client_credentials` 回應不保證含有 `id_token` / `refresh_token`",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SASViyaTokenResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ClientCredentialsTokenResponse"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "password_grant_success": {
                    "summary": "password / refresh_token grant 成功回應範例",
                    "value": {
                      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJ...",
                      "token_type": "bearer",
                      "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJ...",
                      "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJ...",
                      "expires_in": 3600,
                      "scope": "openid",
                      "jti": "abc123-def456"
                    }
                  },
                  "client_credentials_success": {
                    "summary": "client_credentials grant 成功回應範例",
                    "value": {
                      "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJ...",
                      "token_type": "bearer",
                      "expires_in": 3600,
                      "revocable": true,
                      "jti": "abc123-def456",
                      "scope": "uaa.none"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "認證失敗（帳號密碼錯誤、伺服器無法連線）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "認證失敗範例",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "error_description": "Bad credentials"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BasicAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "basic",
        "description": "SASLogon OAuth token flow 可使用的 HTTP Basic Auth。\nHeader 應承載已註冊 OAuth client 的 credentials。\n對 `client_credentials` 而言，這是 upstream documented alternative；\nrepo-local request gate 目前未將其凍結為獨立 request branch。\n"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "PasswordGrantRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "帳號密碼 grant 請求體",
        "required": [
          "grant_type",
          "username",
          "password"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "grant_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "password"
            ],
            "description": "OAuth grant type，固定為 \"password\""
          },
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "SAS Viya 使用者帳號（來自環境變數 `user_id`）",
            "example": "sas_user"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "password",
            "description": "SAS Viya 使用者密碼（來自環境變數 `user_password`）"
          }
        }
      },
      "RefreshTokenGrantRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "refresh_token grant 請求體",
        "required": [
          "grant_type",
          "refresh_token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "grant_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "refresh_token"
            ],
            "description": "OAuth grant type，固定為 \"refresh_token\""
          },
          "refresh_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "先前取得的 refresh_token"
          }
        }
      },
      "SASViyaTokenResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "SAS Viya OAuth token 回應。\n來源：`schema/_token_response.py::SASViyaTokenResponse`\n",
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "token_type",
          "id_token",
          "refresh_token",
          "expires_in",
          "scope",
          "jti"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Bearer token，所有 SAS Viya API 呼叫的認證憑證"
          },
          "token_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "token 類型，固定為 \"bearer\"",
            "example": "bearer"
          },
          "id_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "OpenID Connect ID token"
          },
          "refresh_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "用於重新取得 access_token 的 refresh token"
          },
          "expires_in": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "access_token 有效秒數（程式碼中預留 10 秒緩衝）",
            "example": 3600
          },
          "scope": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "token 授權範圍",
            "example": "openid"
          },
          "jti": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JWT ID，token 的唯一識別碼"
          }
        }
      },
      "ClientCredentialsGrantRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "client_credentials grant 請求體（repo-local form-body baseline）",
        "required": [
          "grant_type",
          "client_id",
          "client_secret"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "grant_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "client_credentials"
            ],
            "description": "OAuth grant type，固定為 \"client_credentials\""
          },
          "client_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "註冊 OAuth client 的 client_id",
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "\\S"
          },
          "client_secret": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "註冊 OAuth client 的 client_secret",
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "\\S"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "ClientCredentialsTokenResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "client_credentials grant 成功回應（illustrative upstream-shaped subset；不是 frozen response truth）",
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "expires_in"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Bearer token，所有 SAS Viya API 呼叫的認證憑證",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "token_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "token 類型，固定為 \"bearer\"",
            "example": "bearer"
          },
          "expires_in": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "access_token 有效秒數",
            "example": 3600,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "scope": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "token 授權範圍；service-to-service baseline 常見為 `uaa.none`",
            "example": "uaa.none"
          },
          "revocable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "token 是否可撤銷"
          },
          "jti": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "JWT ID，token 的唯一識別碼"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
